        {
          "text": "Askartini worra Filisti akuma qara kaani worra Israelitini wolhaati, ammo hojja woli had'ani suni ch'ufa Daudini askarti Saulo taani ch'ufa ira worra balleese. Akanaani guddo beekhame gurra baafate.",
          "type": "text",
